2 CONT Zalman, son of Aser Ansel MAZ (sic) died 26 Oct 1690 and was buried next to his father.
2 CONT
2 CONT House: Meise
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Amsel z. Meise (d. 23.04.1684), son of Lejzer
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Gitlin (d. 04.11.1673), daughter of Herts BONN***
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: -
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Amsel z. Meise, d. 01.12.1763
2 CONT
2 CONT *** N.B. Though the name of Gitlin's father on grandchildren's burial records appears as "Herts BONN" - on Gitlin's own burial record it does carry the addition of "Herts z. grünen Schild". In all cases, anyway, the DOD tallies ex
2 CONC actly with that of the individual Naftali known under various other names ...
2 CONT
2 CONT And also ...
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. Information for grandson Salomon MEISE MAAS ...
