2 CONT Zalman KATS z. roten Lowen died 24.04.1703 and was buried next to his (first) wife Ester.
2 CONT
2 CONT House: roter Löwe
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Kalman z. rot. Löwen (d. 07.04.1689), son of Herts KATS
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Rejzhen (d. 20.12.1659), daughter of Slome KATS
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Ester (d. 23.03.1692), daughter of Koppel
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) circa 1693: the widow of Avrom, Sejnhen (d. 29.04.1704), daughter of Kalman STRAUSS
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Koppel z. rot. Löwen, d. 31.07.1723
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Herts, d. 30.04.1690, unmarried
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Fogel, (d. 14.11.1729), m. Jukkef STIEFEL-HAHN z. Weinfass, then z. weissen Rose
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Rejzhen (d. 27,05,1690), m. Herts BINGEN-SCHUH z. Taube
