2 CONT Valuable details gleaned courtesy of the following website:
2 CONT
2 CONT DigiBaeck Search Results | Leo Baeck Institute
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.lbi.org/digibaeck/results/?qtype=pid&term=258967
2 CONT
2 CONT Ele Toldot ([Burial records of the Jewish community of Frankfurt am Main]), 1241-1824
2 CONT
2 CONT Hinthe, wife of Jone AUH, daughter of Herts BING, died 14 Nov 1723 and was buried next to Brendle SUH (d. 10.07.1719) who was in turn buried in same grave as her husband Zanwel and brother Hindhes.
2 CONT
2 CONT House: Horn
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Herts BINGEN-SCHUH z. Taube (d. 13.04.1702), son of Zanwel
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Rajzhen (d. 27.05.1690), daughter of Zalman KATS
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: circa 1710 to Jone AACH (d. 07.01.1731), son of Merdhe (As widower he married widow Gutle)
2 CONT
2 CONT And also ...
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. Information on second wife of widower Jone AUH/AH ? - Gutl, née "zu Hanau", remarried LURIE ...
