2 CONT
2 CONT Ellihe ULMAN, wife of Itsek Josef ULLMANN, daughter of Itsek ben Josef Hameln- ... died 11 Feb 1794 "im Wochenbett" (sick bed).
2 CONT
2 CONT House: Leichte
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Itsek GOLDSCHMIED-HAMELN z. Flasche (d. 14.06.1784), son of Josef
2 CONT
