2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: on 3 Nov 1789 the divorced husband of Hinle (Henriette): Itsek (Isaac) ULMANN (d. 06.07.1822), son of Josef (as widower on death of Ellihe he then married Ester Ellise) "Deutschland, ausgewählte evangelische Kirchenbüche
2 CONC r 1500-1971," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:QPFH-31H1 : 25 March 2020), Goldschmidt in entry for Töb Isaak Ullmann, 4 Jun 1829; images digitized and records extracted by Ancestry; citing Marriage,
