1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Information on Ancestry.com suggested that Jette and Gütha Fürth were two names for the same woman.  However, records show that they had different dates of birth, different dates of death, and three of the children
2 CONC  were born after Gütha Fürth's death date.  It appears that Jacob Salomon Fürth married Gütha, and after her death in 1836, married Jette in 1837.
