2 CONT
2 CONT Abrahm Friedman was born in Topocani, Czechoslovakia in 1865 to Tzvi Yehuda and Rakhel. He was a rabbi and a widower. Prior to WWII he lived in Satomare, Romania. During the war he was in Satomare, Romania. Abrahm was murdered in 
2 CONC 1944 (sivan 12) in Auschwitz, Camp.
2 CONT
