1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I have removed the photograph from the file of Gustav Schadow.  Another photograph in my collection shows the same person, different pose, as having been done by a photographic studio in Düsseldorf.  To my knowledg
2 CONC e, the Schadow family did not live or have dealings in that city, whereas the husband of Anna Schadow, family name Kusenberg did.
2 CONT
2 CONT From newspaper cuttings, we know that the photo studio was in business in Düsseldorf 1847, 1854 and 1855:   H. Severin Hof-Photograph.
2 CONT
2 CONT Therefore the photo is more likely of Johann Wilhelm Moritz KUSENBERG, 1786-1868.
