2 CONT
2 CONT Otto Heinrich Ullmann Deutschland Geburten und Taufen Sonstige Angaben im Datensatz zu Otto Heinrich Ullmann aus Deutschland Geburten und Taufen Name	Otto Heinrich Ullmann  Ereignisdatum	1838  Geschlecht	Male  Geburtsdatum	17 Jan 
2 CONC 1838  Geburtsjahr	1838  Geburtsort	Frankfurt  Name des Vaters	Löb Isaak Ullmann 
2 CONT
2 CONT Name der Mutter	Hanchen Greünebaum 
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto ULLMANN was a banker, evidently employed for a while by the "Austro-Türkischen Kredit-Anstalt" / Société de Crédit Austro-Turque which involved work in both Paris and Istanbul. (It was probably in the latter town that he met 
2 CONC his wife Catherine CRISTICH).
2 CONT
2 CONT Interesting details on the bank here:
2 CONT
2 CONT Essai sur l'histoire financière de la Turquie : depuis le règne du sultan Mahmoud II jusqu'à nos jours / A. Du Velay | Gallica
2 CONT
2 CONT https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k65442436/f215.image.r=%22Otto%20ullmann%22?rk=665239;2 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Numerous mentions of Otto ULLMANN in contemporaneous Austrian etc. newspapers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Some merely minor noting his stays in various hotels - e.g.:
2 CONT
2 CONT ANNO, Neues Fremden-Blatt, 1865-09-17, Seite 9
2 CONT
2 CONT https://anno.onb.ac.at/cgi-content/anno?aid=nfb&datum=18650917&seite=9&zoom=33&query=%22Konstantinopel%2Bullmann%22~5&ref=anno-search 
2 CONT
2 CONT &
2 CONT
2 CONT ANNO, Pester Lloyd, 1869-06-04, Seite 6
2 CONT
2 CONT https://anno.onb.ac.at/cgi-content/anno?aid=pel&datum=18690604&seite=6&zoom=33&query=%22Konstantinopel%2Bullmann%22~5&ref=anno-search 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The following features his name as an administrator at the "Austro-Türkischen Kredit-Anstalt" in a large announcement about this bank:
2 CONT
2 CONT ANNO, Figaro, 1872-03-16, Seite 9
2 CONT
2 CONT https://anno.onb.ac.at/cgi-content/anno?aid=fig&datum=18720316&seite=9&zoom=33&query=%22Konstantinopel%2Bullmann%22~5&ref=anno-search 
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT The whole ULLMANN & FROMENT-MEURICE families enjoyed a a privileged social status, mixed with prominent people, attended select events etc.  and are frequently mentioned in eg. French newspapers of the era.
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. eg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rothschild-Sammlung / 1897, Teil 2 [162] / Suche "Otto ullmann"
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sammlungen.ub.uni-frankfurt.de/rothschild/content/pageview/4309393?query=%22Otto%20ullmann%22 
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Also cf. 1910 death notice of brother-in-law Philippe CRISTICH.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Mention of death here in French newspaper:
2 CONT
2 CONT La Libre parole / dir. E. Drumont | 1911-07-29 | Gallica
2 CONT
2 CONT https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bpt6k1663617j/f4.image.r=%22Otto%20ullmann%22?rk=278971;2 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral mention - indicating that Otto ULLMANN had, indeed, converted to the Catholic faith as his funeral is held at "l'église St. Honoré-d'Eylau" in Paris:
2 CONT
2 CONT Paris-journal / directeur Gérault-Richard | 1911-07-31 | Gallica
2 CONT
2 CONT https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/bd6t5731564j/f2.image.r=%22Otto%20ullmann%22?rk=579402;0 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial data:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://de.findagrave.com/memorial/242727849/otto-louis_henri-ullmann
2 CONT
2 CONT Otto Louis Henri Ullmann
2 CONT Geburt
2 CONT 17 Jan 1838
2 CONT Frankfurt am Main, Frankfurt am Main, Hessen, Deutschland
2 CONT Tod
2 CONT 27 Juli 1911 (im Alter von 73)
2 CONT Paris, Département de Paris, Île-de-France, Frankreich
2 CONT Bestattung
2 CONT Passy Cemetery
2 CONT Paris, Département de Paris, Île-de-France, Frankreich
