1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bookkeeper for Mayer Amschel Rothschild, the founder of the Rothschild Bank.
2 CONT
2 CONT Crossing the Alps in a carriage upon his return from a visit to the Milan branch of the Rothschild bank, he had loaned his blanket to a fellow passenger who was cold and caught a kidney ailment himself. His tombstone read, "Ever s
2 CONC ince he was young, he helped the poor in need, reached out to the needy and stood by the one who had gone astray. He feared God and was humble. May his piety precede him, and his soul be bound for eternity."
2 CONT
