1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Nathan Ignatz Schotten was an ordained rabbi and served as the cantor and schochet for the small Jewish community of Gloggnitz, Austria. He married three times. His first wife, Lea Rosner, was the mother of his fou
2 CONC r children. Lea  died by 1910. In 1910, Nathan Igantz married Josefa Hacker of Sopron. The marriage didn't last long. Either Josefa died or the couple divorced. In 1911, Nathan Ignatz wed Helene Goldberger of Deutschkreuz.
