1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rudolph Auerbach, b. 1821c inFrankfurt-am-Maine, Germany, d. Sep1907 in Steyning, Sussex. England,[1]occupation Merchant.
2 CONT       RudolphAuerbach was born about 1821 at Frankfurt-am-Maine in Germany, parents detailsnot known. He became a Naturalised British Subject.
2 CONT       Rudolphis listed on Alien Arrival List to Dover - dd 16Jun1847 per Batavier fmRotterdam to London - Merchant. Also 12Oct1848 and 14May1849
2 CONT       fromFrance, b Germany, Merchant and his signature.
2 CONT
2 CONT       In the1851 UK Census - Rudolph is aged 30 years, a Merchant, living at Fore St,Edmonton in Essex - birthplace Frankfurt on the Main.
2 CONT
2 CONT       Rudolphmarried Fanny Solomon 1852 - marriage reg Dec qtr 1852 at St Luke's London ref1b 781.
2 CONT
2 CONT       FannySolomon was born about 1831, daughter of Henry Napthali Solomon and Frances'Fanny' Phillips who married 18May1817 - details not known.
2 CONT       Fannywas from a large family - she had ten siblings - all born London -
2 CONT       HenrySolomon
2 CONT       MauriceHenry Solomon
2 CONT       Louis/LewisHenry Solomon b 1819,
2 CONT       EmmaSolomon b 1826, d 1908 Edmonton, Essex.
2 CONT       DinahSolomon b 1831, d
2 CONT       MariaMaurice Solomon b 1832, d 1895
2 CONT       SydneyPhillip Solomon b 1835, d 5Oct1882
2 CONT       LouisaSolomon b 1836, married Matthias Levy and had three daughters,
2 CONT       GeorgeHenry Jaffa Solomon b 1837, d 31Jan1881
2 CONT       CharlesMoses Solomon b 19Apr1839,
2 CONT
2 CONT       In the1841 Census Henry and Frances are living at Fore St, Edmonton with their family- Henry 45 School Master, Frances 45. Children - Henry 20, Lewis 20, Dina 15,Emma 15, Fanny 13, Maria 10, Louisa 9, Sydney 8, George 6, Cha
2 CONC rles 2 and SarahIsrael aged 10 years.
2 CONT       (Agesfor adults above 15, rounded down to the nearest 5 in 1841 Census!)
2 CONT       In the1851 Census Henry and Fanny are still living at Fore St - Henry 54, School Master,Fanny 53 - children Dinah 25, Fanny 20, Maria 19, Louisa 17, Sydney 16, George14, Charles 11 - with 4 servants, an Assistant Teacher and
2 CONC  lots of pupils.
2 CONT
2 CONT       Rudolphand Fanny had six children -
2 CONT       JohannaMaria Auerbach b 1854 - reg Mar qtr Hackney, London ref 1b 288
2 CONT       Henry'Harry' Auerbach b 1856 - reg Dec qtr Hackney, London ref 1b 265
2 CONT       EmmaAuerbach b 1857 - reg Mar qtr Hackney ref 1b 299
2 CONT       RudolphLeopold Auerbach b 1858 - reg Jun qtr Edmonton ref 3a 121, married ElizabethWhitney 14Mar1894 in Honolulu - five children on Painter Tree on Ancestry.
2 CONT       **FrankBond Auerbach b 1861 - reg Mar qtr Edmonton ref 3a 126
2 CONT       IdaAugusta Auerbach b 1863 - reg Jun qtr 1863 Edmonton ref 3a 134, married LeopoldHenry Auerbach 1900.
2 CONT
2 CONT       In the1861 Census the family is living at 1 Bruce Tce, Tottenham in London.
2 CONT       Rudolphis 41, b Prussian Naturalised, Fanny 37, b Hammersmith, children Johanna 7,Harry 5, Emma 4, Rudolph 3 and baby Frank B aged 3 months. Also with them are anurse and housemaid.
2 CONT       In the1871 Census Rudolph is now aged 50, Colonial Merchant living at 11 Anson Rd,Islington with wife Fanny 44. Their children are Johanna 17, **Harry 15, Emma14, Rudolph 12, Frank 10 and Edith 7 - there are two servants.
2 CONT
2 CONT       In1881 the family is living at 1 Chepstow Villas, Dartmonth Park Hill - Rudolph61 Merchant, Fanny 54. Their children Johanna 27, Harry 25 Commercial Clerk,Emma 24, Rudolph 23 Commercial Clerk and Ida Augusta 17 - also a Cook
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT       In1891 Rudolph 71 Steel Manufacturer (surname Auerbuck) living at 14 Gatcombe Rd,Islington. Wife Fanny now 64. Children Johanna 37 Trainee Nurse, Edith (Ida)now aged 27. There is also a Servant.
2 CONT
2 CONT       In1901 Rudolph living at Worthing in Sussex - he is a Boarder aged 81 years(surname written as Anelbach!) living at 4 The Esplanade with Sarah Wicking,widow aged 61 years, Retired Piano Teacher. Rudolph is Living on own Mean
2 CONC s.
2 CONT
2 CONT       Meanwhilewife Fanny, now aged 74 years is living at Lymingham Rd, Canterbury inHampstead - mother-in-law to Leopold Henry Auerbach 48 Hop Merchant and wifeIda 37 - Leopold and Ida were married Hamstead 1900 - marriage reg Se
2 CONC p qtr ref1a 1547. There is also a Cook.
2 CONT
2 CONT       Fannydied 1905 - death reg Hampstead in Jun qtr ref 1a 381 aged 78 years.
2 CONT       Rudolphdied 1907 - death reg Jul qtr Steyning in Sussex ref 2b 148 aged 87 years.  He married Fanny Solomon, married Dec1852 in StLuke's, London, Middlesex. England.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT [1]  Free BMDIndex, Death reg Steyning Sussex ref 2b 148 aged 87 years. [2]  Free BMDIndex, Marriage reg St Luke's Dec qtr 1b 781.
