1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  	 Lily Beran nee Marks was born in Mannheim in 1878 to Yulius. She was a seamstress and divorced. Prior to WWII she lived in Frankfurt Am Main, Germany. During the war she was in Frankfurt Am Main, Germany. Lily p
2 CONC erished in 1942 in Frankfurt Am Main, Germany. This information is based on a Page of Testimony found in the Pages of Testimony. 
