1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Julie Julia GATZERT, née LEVI: b. circa 1859, Alzey - d. 8 Jan 1931, Köln
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Information courtesy of various sources including the following.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1882 Heinrich GATZERT & Julie LEVI become engaged:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.deutsche-digitale-bibliothek.de/newspaper/item/LU476N4Z...
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1883 the couple made a financial agreement:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.deutsche-digitale-bibliothek.de/newspaper/item/KBJPHRD2DAPYOKMK6JV23HVLD4XLX6DP?gclid=Cj0KCQjw9rSoBhCiARIsAFOiplkOHiMHV82dJEndiKpO357nvst17EVQvrfIFTy83MQa_alnM59N1EQaAmn0EALw_wcB&query=%22Heinrich+gatzert%22&pk_campaig
2 CONC n=gas_zeitung_236&sort=sort.publication_date+asc&hit=&issuepage=3
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT It appears this couple had a third son in August 1889 but the child was probably short-lived:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.deutsche-digitale-bibliothek.de/newspaper/item/KGEJG7AG...
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. death notice in Kölnische Zeitung:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.deutsche-digitale-bibliothek.de/newspaper/item/DATXGN3WDL6X2LKZN7P4R57NNLGYXY5L?gclid=Cj0KCQjw9rSoBhCiARIsAFOiplkOHiMHV82dJEndiKpO357nvst17EVQvrfIFTy83MQa_alnM59N1EQaAmn0EALw_wcB&pk_campaign=gas_zeitung_236&sort=sort.p
2 CONC ublication_date+asc&query=%22Julie+gatzert%22&hit=&issuepage=4
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT And also -
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. information on son Dr. jur Richard GATZERT ...
