1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (1) GLASNER, Moses Samuel	(b. 27-Feb-1856, Bratislava). Parents: Abraham Glasner & Therese EHRENFELD. Birth Record: Pozsony / 032-14 (Local Gov't). Note: Mother is daughter of D. H. Ehrenfeld. Source: LDS 2442169, 
2 CONC Item 6. 
2 CONT
2 CONT (2a) http://hebrewbooks.org/pdfpager.aspx?req=726&st=&pgnum=5 (2b) http://dor4.net16.net. (2c) http://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%A4%D7%97%D7%AA_%D7%92%D7%9C%D7%96%D7%A0%D7%A8
